        "TileImage": "$($repository fc56064c-1b5a-40d7-b193-9bfc209f5358).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47. Our client today has sanctioned multiple hits because their proposal for Kronstadt branded axes was rejected. The client has a personal vendetta against each target, and they have made sure the ICA is aware of this by sending us a 39 page document about the targets. For the sake of the little brevity in the document, the client wants each target to be killed with axes whilst wearing Kronstdadt engineer uniform. Simple contract for you. I shall leave you to prepare. Good luck.",
